{
    "background_story": "Amaia was a brilliant and fearless astronaut who had always been fascinated by the mysteries of the universe. She spent years training for the mission of a lifetime: to explore the distant planet of Tellus, a world shrouded in mist and legend. As the first human to set foot on Tellus, Amaia was awestruck by the planet's breathtaking landscapes and strange, glowing flora. Her crew's discoveries on Tellus would rewrite the textbooks on astrobiology and challenge humanity's understanding of the cosmos. But Amaia's journey was not just about science - it was also a personal quest to uncover the secrets of her own past, which seemed to be connected to the mysterious energy signature emanating from the heart of Tellus. As she delved deeper into the planet's mysteries, Amaia began to unravel a tale that would change her life forever.",
